<!doctype html>
<html lang="pt-PT">
<head>
	<meta charset="utf-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
	<meta name="x-apple-disable-message-reformatting">
	<title>Confirmar email — Na Grade</title>
	<!--[if mso]><style>body, table, td, h1, p, a { font-family: Arial, sans-serif !important; }</style><![endif]-->
	<style>
		@media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
			.email-shell { padding: 28px 16px !important; }
			.email-body { padding: 30px 24px !important; }
			.email-heading { font-size: 30px !important; line-height: 36px !important; }
			.email-code { font-size: 32px !important; letter-spacing: 7px !important; }
		}
	</style>
</head>
<body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; width: 100%; background-color: #f2f6f5; color: #171717; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;">
	<div style="display: none; font-size: 1px; line-height: 1px; color: #f2f6f5; max-height: 0; max-width: 0; opacity: 0; overflow: hidden; mso-hide: all;">Confirma o teu email com este código para concluir o registo no Na Grade. Válido durante 10 minutos.</div>
	<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" bgcolor="#f2f6f5" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #f2f6f5;">
		<tr>
			<td class="email-shell" align="center" style="padding: 44px 24px;">
				<!--[if mso]><table role="presentation" width="560" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0"><tr><td><![endif]-->
				<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; max-width: 560px; border-collapse: collapse;">
					<tr>
						<td align="center" style="padding: 0 0 28px;">
							<img src="cid:na-grade-logo" alt="Na Grade" width="192" height="64" border="0" style="display: block; width: 192px; height: 64px; max-width: 100%; border: 0; color: #0f766e; font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold;">
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td bgcolor="#ffffff" style="background-color: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #dfe8e5; border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden;">
							<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse;">
								<tr><td height="5" bgcolor="#0f766e" style="height: 5px; background-color: #0f766e; border-radius: 16px 16px 0 0; font-size: 1px; line-height: 5px;">&nbsp;</td></tr>
								<tr>
									<td class="email-body" style="padding: 40px;">
										<p style="margin: 0 0 18px; color: #0f766e; font-size: 11px; line-height: 16px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.6px; text-transform: uppercase;">Confirmar email</p>
										<h1 class="email-heading" style="margin: 0 0 20px; color: #172b28; font-size: 36px; line-height: 42px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: -1px;">Os teus concertos<br>começam aqui.</h1>
										<p style="margin: 0 0 28px; color: #596b66; font-size: 16px; line-height: 26px;">Confirma o teu email para criar a tua conta no Na Grade. Volta ao site e introduz este código para concluir o registo.</p>
										<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" bgcolor="#edf7f3" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #edf7f3; border-radius: 12px;">
											<tr>
												<td align="center" style="padding: 24px 16px;">
													<p style="margin: 0 0 8px; color: #345c51; font-size: 11px; line-height: 18px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1.5px;">O TEU CÓDIGO</p>
													<p class="email-code" style="margin: 0; color: #0f766e; font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace; font-size: 40px; line-height: 52px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 10px; user-select: all;"><%= code %></p>
												</td>
											</tr>
										</table>
										<p style="margin: 18px 0 0; color: #596b66; font-size: 13px; line-height: 22px;">Válido durante <strong>10 minutos</strong> e para um único registo. Não partilhes este código com ninguém.</p>
										<p style="margin: 24px 0 28px; color: #596b66; font-size: 14px; line-height: 23px;">Não fizeste este pedido? Podes ignorar este email.<br>Nenhuma conta será criada sem a confirmação.</p>
									</td>
								</tr>
							</table>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td align="center" style="padding: 24px 16px 0; color: #667a72; font-size: 12px; line-height: 20px;">
							<p style="margin: 0 0 4px; color: #345c51; font-weight: bold;">Na Grade</p>
							<p style="margin: 0;">O teu histórico. Os teus próximos concertos.</p>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
				<!--[if mso]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->
			</td>
		</tr>
	</table>
</body>
</html>
